Alembic migrations live here.

Run locally:
- set DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://...
- alembic -c alembic.ini upgrade head

Railway URL compatibility
-------------------------
Railway may expose PostgreSQL references with the legacy ``postgres://``
scheme. ``db/migrations/env.py`` normalises ``postgres://``, ``postgresql://``
and ``postgresql+asyncpg://`` to ``postgresql+psycopg2://`` before SQLAlchemy
creates the synchronous Alembic engine.
